         <pdf:Keywords>Keywords: banksâ€™ sovereign holdings, sovereign crisis, moral hazard, central bank liquidity,&#xD;&#xA;EMU financial fragmentation.&#xD;&#xA;JEL Classification: G01, G21, H63.</pdf:Keywords>
